window.products.push({"id":1174036,"name":"Hoibampu 2PCS 1080P WiFi Socket Light Bulb Security Camera 2.4GHz & 5G 360 Degree Wireless Smart Surveillance Blubs Camera Smart Premium Two-Way Talk ","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ibgC+4jZL._AC_SL1407_.jpg","description":"💡【HD Pan Tilt&WiFi Wireless Connection 】This Pan Tilt WiFi camera can provide you with a clear vision (Full HD 1080P(1920*1080) resolution) at any time, You can use the APP to control the camera viewing angle to achieve without blind spots. The maximum horizontal rotation angle of the bulb security camera is 355 degrees, not 360 degrees cyclically. 💡【Work on Alexa & Qucik Connection】Our camera supports Alexa voice assistant, which will improve the operation of a great convenience. This wireless WiFi bulb camera automatically recognizes your home router frequency 2.4GHz,our camera can give you more wireless wifi options and control your camera more smoothly. It can be installed using a normal E27 bulb base(110V~240V), open the app to set up the camera within minutes, Supports multiple people watching at the same time. 💡【Two-Way Audio and Cloud Storage】: Built in high quality Mic and speaker,the security camera allows you to communicate with family through the app whenever & wherever you are, which is a perfect monitoring system for schools, offices and homes.Note:Our camera supports Micro SD Card and Cloud storage. 💡【AI Motion Detection & Real-time Alerts & 2 Night Vision Modes】The outdoor security camera adopts a high-sensitivity motion sensor and AI tracking tech. Once the camera detects the movement of the object after connecting it to the Internet, it will record the moving picture and notify you through the APP. The lightbulb security cam outdoor supports switching full-color night vision and infrared night vision to keep your property safe even in the dark. 💡【Comes With a Complete Package】 A complete package comes with every purchase of our wireless light bulb camera: 2x bulb socket plug, 1x reset needle, and 1x user manual. We have a clear and easy-to-follow product manual for hassle-free lightbulb camera mobile set-up and modifications to suit your preferences and provide your family with the solution to safety that they deserve.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ibgC+4jZL._AC_SL1407_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hoibampu","source_asin":"B0BF4MT6QD","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1174036","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF4MT6QD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF4MT6QD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
