window.products.push({"id":1174071,"name":"Panasonic DVD-LA95 9-Inch Portable DVD Player","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FH7AS00NL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Take technology with you wherever you go with the Panasonic DVD-LA95 Portable DVD Player. Enjoy DVD-RAM video playback in this compact fold-over design in sleek silvertone. Features include CD-R/RW and MP-3 playback lecture; DVD audio that includes super hi-fi (192 kHz and 24 bit) and multi-channel sound; compact disk digital video; Dolby digital DTS surround; wide 9\" LCD screen; built-in stereo speakers and Dolby digital and DTS decoders; virtual surround sound; dialogue enhancer; hi-speed smooth motion scan (x100) and headphone VSS. Includes a rechargeable battery pack, remote control with button-type battery, audio/video cable, AC adapter, AC power supply cord and built-in battery. 1Hx9Wx6-3/4D\". Amazon.com Panasonic's DVD-LA95 offers the versatility of a portable DVD player alongside the performance of a sophisticated home-theater component--and you can use it as both. The player handles DVD-Video, high-resolution DVD-Audio, and DVD-RAM playback--as well as standard and recordable CDs, including MP3-encoded discs. Its slender chassis holds a massive, 9-inch widescreen (16:9) LCD screen and a built-in rechargeable battery (good for about 2.5 hours between charges). Designed to take full advantage of both audio and traditional video DVD formats, the DVD-LA95 delivers the immersive six-channel surround sound of the DVD-Audio music format. DVD-Audio offers super high-fidelity (192 kHz/24-bit) sound, in both multichannel and stereo. Because the DVD-Audio signal is too high-resolution for the digital converters in current surround receivers (and also as an anti-piracy measure), the DVD-LA95 performs its own decoding of DVD-Audio signals, passing high-resolution analog , not digital, audio to your surround receiver. This means you'll need an audio/video receiver with multichannel analog-audio inputs to appreciate this feature. Audio features include DTS and Dolby Digital decoding with 5.1-channel analog- and digital-audio outputs, built-in stereo speakers, and Dialogue Enhancer for DVD movie viewing (which boosts the center-channel level by 6 dB during playback of Dolby Digital 5.1 discs, since most of the principal dialogue is channeled there). Advanced Surround Sound (VSS) simulates surround effects from any two speakers or from headphones. Other features include chapter preview, high-speed smooth-motion scan in forward and reverse (up to 100 times normal speed), repeat mode, title/chapter search with marker function, skip forward/reverse, auto power off, and resume play. In addition to playing favorite DVD movie and music discs, the DVD-LA95 also plays video recorded on DVD-RAMs. DVD-RAM lets you record high-quality MPEG-2 video on DVDs, offering fast data transmission, speedy random access to chapters, and rewritability up to 100,000 times. From the Manufacturer Bringing together the most advanced digital audio and video technologies, the DVD-LA95 offers the versatility of a portable and the high-quality performance of a sophisticated home-theater component. The unique DVD-LA95 is the world's first portable DVD player that accommodates DVD Video, DVD-Audio, DVD-RAM, CDs, MP3, CD-R, and CD-RW. The unit features a 9-inch LCD screen--the largest of any portables at the time of its release--and a built-in rechargeable battery. Designed to take full advantage of the DVD format in both video and its newer dedicated audio incarnation, DVD-Audio, the versatile DVD-LA95 delivers the incredible six-channel surround sound of the new DVD-Audio format--the closest thing possible to experiencing a live performance. To realize the full potential of DVD-Audio, the DVD-LA95 features a 192kHz/24-bit audio DAC (digital-to-analog converter). The DVD-Audio format offers storage capacity about seven times that of a CD, dynamic range reaching a theoretical high of 144 dB (versus 96 dB for CD), and a frequency response stretching all the way to 96 kHz. Using linear PCM for all six discrete channels, DVD-Audio delivers astounding fidelity. For home theater enjoyment, other audio features include built-in DTS and Dolby Digital decoding with a 5.1-channel analog audio output for surround sound enjoyment through a compatible surround receiver, built-in speakers, and Dialogue Enhancer for DVD movie viewing. This last feature boosts the volume of the center channel, from which most principal dialogue emanates, for movies that feature Dolby Digital 5.1 sound. For complete audio enjoyment, the DVD-LA95 plays MP3 files recorded on CD-R/RW media, commercially produced CDs, and home-recorded CD-R and CD-RW discs. (It may not be able to play some CD-R or CD-RW due to the condition of the recording.) A built-in, 9-inch LCD screen is ideal for watching DVD movies \"on the go.\" The DVD-LA95 delivers a stunningly beautiful picture in 4:3 or 16:9 aspect ratio. A 10-bit video DAC minimizes digital artifacts for optimal picture quality. Other features include chapter preview; high-speed, five-step smooth motion scan (in forward a","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FH7AS00NL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panasonic","source_asin":"B00005OP2T","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1174071","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005OP2T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005OP2T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
