window.products.push({"id":1174101,"name":"Tenergy Premium 9V Battery Rechargeable 250mAh 8PCS NiMH Square Battery with TN136 4 Bay 9V Battery Charger for Smoke Alarm/Detector","category":"electronics","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71epW4JsSPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tenergy TN136 9V 4-Channel NiMH Battery Charger Ideal 4 bays/ports: with 4 ports instead of 2, you will not need to wait as long to charge multiple batteries at a time Worldwide voltage range 100V – 240VAC – voltage range allows you to use this charger in other countries with different voltages without requiring a converter (but may still need a plug adapter) Built-in technology: 5 hr timer, micro-controller, circuit and reverse polarity protection, and delta V charging to make sure your batteries are fully. Charger Specifications: Outlet input voltage: 12V Charge current: 100mA Operating Temp: 0 ~ 40°C Weight: 70g Tenergy Premium 9V 200mAh Batteries: Robust performance with higher current capabilities – perfect for high drain devices like RC controllers, transmitters, and portable digital electronics NiMH – without memory effect – you can charge the battery whenever you need to, without having to wait for it to drain all the way first. Compatible with 9V NiMH chargers High capacity of 250mAh – providing longer run time than some other 9V batteries with lower capacities Can be recharged at least 500 times so you can save money on replacing hundreds of disposable Alkaline one-time use 9V batteries  Should you buy Tenergy PREMIUM line or CENTURA Line? (This package comes with Premium ) Buy Premium if: You will use the batteries frequently and they will not sit idle for long periods of time You need longer run time and higher capacity Your device is high drain (cameras, radios, game controllers, etc) Buy Centura if: Your device doesn’t require high drain and can last for a long period of time (clocks, alarms, smoke detectors)The device or batteries are more idle than usedNote: Charger is designed to work with button top rechargeable batteries, does not work with flat top batteries","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71epW4JsSPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tenergy","source_asin":"B01FT8YJGS","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1174101","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FT8YJGS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FT8YJGS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1174102,"name":"AntennaMastsRus - 10 Inch Screw-On Antenna is Compatible with Ford Flex (2009-2019)","category":"electronics","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SPVjPZlkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your MAST Broken, Deteriorating, Stolen or Bent? Looking for an antenna to get rid of that obnoxiously tall un-stylish antenna your vehicle comes with? Then this is the antenna solution for you! This is a Very High Quality FUBA Style Replacement Antenna Mast/Whip designed for your Roof Mount Antenna. These Whip/Masts feature the twisted wire that runs up the mast to reduce wind noise. Our Mast will be the Highest Quality non OE Mast you will find here On Amazon, Just Look at the photos of any competitors masts. These are an easy screw-on installation with No Modification, Cutting, or Drilling. Any questions or concerns on any of our products feel free to contact us by telephone or email by clicking on AntennaMastsRus about us page here on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SPVjPZlkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AntennaMastsRus","source_asin":"B00PT5ID46","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1174102","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PT5ID46","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PT5ID46","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1174103,"name":"Sony SRS-Z30 Personal Active Speakers with 6 Watts of Power","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/11AJGW2S56L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description SONY SRS-Z30 Travel Speakers Amazon.com The SRS-Z30 active speakers succeed in supplying a powerful sound from a small package. The speakers have die-cast aluminum chassis stands, the color of which match Sony's Discman and MiniDisc portable recorders and players. The color is also a classy, high-tech color and looks appropriate in any room setting. The speakers are powered by an included AC adaptor. Built-in controls for volume and power are front mounted for easy access. Included in the package is a two meter (6.6 feet) connecting cord with a stereo mini-jack, the ideal cord for connecting these speakers to a wide range of components. There are two analog inputs which allows you to connect with two components. The headphone jack provides the opportunity to quiet the room with use of a pair of headphones. The built-in amplifier produces six watts of power. Sony also uses sigma-type magnetic circuitry which aids in producing a deep bass sound. The 2 1/4 inch speakers deliver excellent sound for their size. The 2 1/4 inch bass reflex woofer has a folded sound duct for high acoustic output. Sony has also engineered its Mega Bass feature into the speakers. Stylish looks, crisp sound, quality bass: the SRS-Z30 creates big sound in a small package. What's in the Box Sony SRS-Z30 speaker system, connecting cord, AC adaptor, user's manual and a ninety day warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/11AJGW2S56L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sony","source_asin":"B000095SAW","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1174103","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000095SAW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B000095SAW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
