window.products.push({"id":1174138,"name":"Skooba Messenger Sleeve (Blizzard White)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DSoUA1XoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you are looking for a minimalist case to protect and carry your minimalist computer, Our Netbook Neo-Sleeve is what you're looking for. Form-fitting, stretchy and cushy neoprene skin covers your 'book without adding much weight or bulk. Carry it inside any other bag, or on its own using the included, removable shoulder strap. In addition to the main netbook compartment, there's a front pocket for your power adapter, and even a special slot for a USB thumb drive. CHECKPOINT-FRIENDLY--The sleeve may be put through airport screening without removing the computer, as long as the netbook is alone in the sleeve as per TSA requirements. The Netbook Neo-Sleeve will fit netbooks up to 10.1-Inch screen size (or 11-Inch x 7.5-Inch x 1.5-Inch overall chassis size). All Skooba checkpoint-friendly bags have been designed and rigorously tested in close collaboration with the TSA, and meet all of the necessary requirements. It is the user's responsibility to make sure any checkpoint-friendly bag is packed and used as specified. In all instances, screening personnel always have the right to require laptop removal, secondary screening, or any other measures deemed necessary to ensure travel security. Zippered main compartment holds any netbook up to 10.1 inch screen size. Stretchy neoprene hugs and protects computer. Front accessory compartment holds power adapter. There's even a special, protective slot for your USB thumb drive. Removable shoulder strap included. Comes in 4 great color combos. Primary materials: Highly water-resistant neoprene (the same material used in diving wetsuits) Hardware and trim: Genuine YKK zippers--the best and most reliable zippers money can buy. Overall Size: 12-Inch L x 7.5-Inch H x .75-Inch D. Weight: 6.4 oz.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DSoUA1XoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Skooba","source_asin":"B002WRIBJQ","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1174138","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002WRIBJQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B002WRIBJQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
