window.products.push({"id":1174327,"name":"ACKSKY USB C Hub, 5-in-1 USB C Multiport Adapter with USB 3.0 Port, 2 USB 2.0 Ports and SD/Micro SD Card Reader, Type C to USB Adapter Compatible with","category":"electronics","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61grBF05RDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【5-in-1 USB C Hub】The USB-C multiport hub come with 1*USB 3.0 port, 2*USB 2.0 ports and SD / Micro SD card reader slots.SD supports SD/SDHC/SDXC, TF supports Micro SD/SDHC/SDXC. Plug and play, fast transfer and export of batch pictures, you can view files, play and share videos, transfer data, etc.Easily transfer and/or backup photos to your laptop. 【Super High Speed Data Transfer】USB 3.0 port provides 5Gbps stable data transfer, USB 2.0 D port provides 480Mbps data transfer speed, SD/Micro SD card reader can be support up to 1TB SD card to transfer the data. 【OTG Supported】This USB C to USB 3.0 Hub allows you mount an OTG device on your phone （base on your device have OTG function）, this is, you can certainly add a mouse/keyboard to your smartphone and/or tablet, using the OTG functionality.Besides the OTG, you can read your old SD /Micro SD cards using this as a thumb drive. Just insert the SD/micro SD card on the correct slot, and then your PC system should recognize it as an external USB drive. 【Stable Performance】ABS environmentally friendly material, which can quickly export the heat generated inside to the surface of the product, accelerate the heat dissipation of the product, and make the transmission more stable.Built-in LED indicator identifies working status. 【Wide Compatibility】This USB C Hub 3.0 &2.0 can be used compatible Windows 10, 8, 7, Vista, XP, Mac OS (10.x or higher), Chrome OS and Linux. You can use Type-C ports such as tablets or laptops to USB-A ports, USB-C adapters can also be used to connect USB-A devices. Directly read SD/TF data at high speed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61grBF05RDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ACKSKY","source_asin":"B09XBD9BK1","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1174327","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XBD9BK1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XBD9BK1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1174328,"name":"Fujifilm Instax Square SQ20 Hybrid Instant Camera (Beige) - Basic Accessory Bundle with 20 Sheets of Instant Film + 16GB Micro sd Card + Case + Xpix C","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810jcfAA8BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hybrid instant camera combines convenient digital image capture with traditional instant film output. This method allows you to shoot freely and print whenever desired, or reprint an image as many times as desired. Fixed 33.4mm-equivalent lens offers a versatile wide-angle perspective and the f/2.4 aperture is well-suited for working in a variety of lighting conditions. The lens also affords a 3.1\" Minimum focusing distance for working with close-up subjects and 4x digital zoom. Frame Grab mode allows you to record up to 15 seconds of video and then choose the best moment of the video to print as a still frame. Time Shift Collage records four images with one press which are then compiled into a grid on a single print. Rounded, symmetrical body design and central lens placement is easy to handle and the body incorporates dual right and left shutter release buttons. Built-in rechargeable lithium-ion battery is used to power the camera, and supports printing up to approximately 100 images per charge. It can be charged via USB in approximately 3-4 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810jcfAA8BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fujifilm","source_asin":"B07KFQNW41","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1174328","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KFQNW41","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KFQNW41","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
