window.products.push({"id":1174372,"name":"8K Fiber Optic HDMI 2.1 Cable 30ft HDMI 2.1 CL3 Rated 8K@60Hz 4K@120Hz D-o-l-b-y Vision 48Gbps and eARC D-o-l-b-y Atmos - HDCP 2.2/2.3 for PS5 PS4 Xbo","category":"electronics","retail price":55.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P17cU2MUL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【8K@60Hz & 48Gbps】This 8K HDMI Cable uses the most cutting-edge technology, is compatible with 8K@60HZ and 4K@120HZ, clearly displays every particle, and accurately processes every signal source. With 8K HDMI's unique dynamic HDR and 12 Bit color processing technology, each scene of the video is every frame, with more ideal depth, brightness, detail, contrast and wider color gamut. ✔【Key Features】8K fiber optic HDMI cable support long distance at 8K@60Hz, 4K@60Hz/120Hz/144Hz & up to 10K resolution. No signal loss. Compatible with Dolby Atmos, Dolby Vision, HDCP 2.2 & 2.3, DTS:X, Dynamic HDR, BT.2020, eARC, ALLM, QFT, QMS, VRR. Backward compatible with earlier versions of HDMI.★ If you need higher refresh rate (like,4K@120Hz/144Hz) please make sure your device support it. ✔【 An Ideal HDMI Cable for Gamer 】 AVSTAR 8K HDMI Cable works flawlessly for game console,such as PS5,PS4,Xbox,etc. It supports Quick Frame Transport (QFT), which reduces latency for smoother no-lag gaming and real-time interactive virtual reality. Auto Low Latency Mode (ALLM) enables the ideal latency setting to automatically be set allowing for smooth, lag-free and uninterrupted viewing and interactivity. HDR10, Variable Refresh Rate (VRR) ,Dynamic HDR and Enhanced Audio Return Channel (eARC); ✔【Installation】 It must be installed in the correct direction: The Cable with \"Source\" plug for connecting HDMI Out devices(Blu-ray player, STBox, Xbox one etc.); \"Display\" plug for connecting your HDMI display devices(TV, Projector,Monitor etc.). Thin and Flexible, easy to wiring in wall. ✔【 The Highest standard HDMI Cable 】HDMI Fiber Optic Cable is made of high quality glass fiber for pure signal transmission. Can ensure the full 48Gbps HDMI signal transmission without signal loss. Every cable and even every part has been put through rigorous testing. Any questions please do not hesitate to contact us via amazon at first. We will provide our best service and solution to you. *Note: Please read the product description below carefully before ordering.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P17cU2MUL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AVFABUL","source_asin":"B08ZHM5475","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1174372","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZHM5475","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZHM5475","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
