window.products.push({"id":1174522,"name":"Kenko LENS2SCOPE Adapter for Canon EF/EF-S Mount, Angled View","category":"electronics","retail price":179.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41P4x5pC4+L._AC_.jpg","description":"This innovative product is a great addition to your SLR camera collection. Weighing just 185g, Lens2scope unlashes the power of your camera lenses and turns them into powerful spotting scopes in a click. With advanced ED, APO glass and aspherical elements used in modern camera lenses, you can take full advantage of the high quality optics and enjoy pin-sharp observation with Lens2scope.Having a quality spotting scope and camera lens in your camera bag without all the extra weight is now possible. When attached to your camera lens, the spotting scope magnification becomes the focal length divided by 10. For example, when attached to a 70-300mm tele-zoom lens, the combination creates a 7-30X zoom spotting scope. Macro lenses can also be used: With a 1:1 magnification macro lens, it becomes a 25X loupe with a right-erected image.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41P4x5pC4+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sony","source_asin":"B006WASCC0","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1174522","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006WASCC0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B006WASCC0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1174523,"name":"Twelve South SurfacePad for MacBook, Perfect Pink | Leather Cover for 13-inch MacBook","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h8Gh7NSbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description SurfacePad brings a sophisticated new level of luxury, style and personalization to your MacBook. An ultra-thin sliver of super soft, luxury leather is custom tailored to seamlessly cover the keyboard deck and wrist rest area of your MacBook. Not only will your Mac have a brilliant new look, it will also be more comfortable than ever to work on. From the Manufacturer SurfacePad Colors: Bringing Color Back To Your Mac. Give your MacBook a totally new, totally original look with SurfacePad Colors from Twelve South.   Remember the amazing original iMacs in five different colors? Notice the rainbow of colors iPods come in? Now you can bring a burst of color to your plain white MacBook or 13-inch MacBook Pro with SurfacePad Colors Custom Covers for MacBook and 13-inch MacBook Pro.   Available in a variety of colors, these super thin layers of soft leather give you a fun new way to personalize and protect your MacBook. Each is tailored to seamlessly cover the keyboard deck and wrist rest area while making it more comfortable to use. Better yet, this hit of color makes your MacBook fit your unique personality and style. More information: Features Protects against stains and scratches Protects against stains and scratches Adds a luxury napa leather work surface Adds a luxury napa leather work surface MacBook operates and closes as normal MacBook operates and closes as normal Adhesive keeps SurfacePad in place, then leaves nothing behind when removed Adhesive keeps SurfacePad in place, then leaves nothing behind when removed Compatibility 13-inch MacBook Pro (unibody) 13-inch MacBook Pro (unibody) 13-inch MacBook (white unibody) 13-inch MacBook (white unibody) 13-inch MacBook (2008 unibody 13-inch MacBook (2008 unibody What's in the Box Twelve South SurfacePad Twelve South SurfacePad About Twelve South Twelve South is here to create beautifully designed accessories exclusively for Apple computers. We know Mac users. We are Mac users. We feel it’s time to stop settling for PC accessories that are painted white and passed off as \"Mac compatible\". It’s time for a company to focus on Mac accessories exclusively.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h8Gh7NSbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Twelve South","source_asin":"B0041Q449M","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1174523","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0041Q449M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0041Q449M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1174524,"name":"XSPC EC6 High Performance Premix Coolant, 1000 mL, Blood Red","category":"electronics","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SsEAYGasL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"XSPC EC6 is a high performance, eco-friendly coolant for PC water-cooling. It's based on a blend of refined vegetable extracts with non-toxic corrosion inhibitors and non-toxic dyes. It offers superb protection for copper, brass, steel, nickel, aluminium and has been tested with a range of acetal and acrylic plastics. EC6 has a high thermal conductivity, a low electrical conductivity and with its range of intense colours it's the perfect coolant for PC water-cooling. EC6 can be recoloured with EC6 ReColour Dye. Do not mix with other water additives. Does not contain ethylene glycol or a bittering agent. Model: 5060175582768","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SsEAYGasL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XSPC","source_asin":"B008PA1EQG","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1174524","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008PA1EQG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B008PA1EQG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
