window.products.push({"id":1174609,"name":"Asus Eee Pad Slate EP121 Tablet Screen Protector + Carbon Fiber Full Body, Skinomi TechSkin Carbon Fiber Skin for Asus Eee Pad Slate EP121 Tablet with","category":"electronics","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31IhuCpqbPL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Asus Eee Pad Slate EP121 Carbon Fiber Skin Protector is the clear choice for maximum scratch protection. The Asus Eee Pad Slate EP121 Carbon Fiber Skin Protector goes beyond your traditional Asus Eee Pad Slate EP121 Carbon Fiber screen protectors, skins, covers, and cases. TechSkin is made from the same film material used to protect luxury cars, military aircrafts, and NASA space shuttles. The Asus Eee Pad Slate EP121 Carbon Fiber Skin Protector is custom made to specifically fit the Asus Eee Pad Slate EP121 Carbon Fiber. Carry and protect your Asus Eee Pad Slate EP121 with style!Asus Eee Pad Slate EP121 Carbon Fiber Skin Protector Features: • Dry application for Carbon Fiber Skin • Includes Skinomi Screen Protector • Tough protective Carbon Fiber textured skin • Virtually indestructible skin protector • Preserves your Asus Eee Pad Slate EP121's original design • Protects your Asus Eee Pad Slate EP121 from scratches, dents, and physical wear-and-tear • Provides protection without affecting the functions of your Asus Eee Pad Slate EP121 • Non-sticky or restrictive outer surface Included: • Asus Eee Pad Slate EP121 Carbon Fiber Skin Protector • Asus Eee Pad Slate EP121 Screen Protector • 1 Bottle of Application Solution (for screen protector) • Installation Instructions • Lifetime Warranty Compatible with:Asus Eee Pad Slate EP121The Asus Eee Pad Slate EP121 Screen Protector features two layers of protection. The first, topmost layer contains no unsightly \"orange peel effect,\" while providing scratch-resistance and UV protection for anti-yellowing. The second layer is a thick, puncture resistant film to minimize damage from scrapes and dents. Unlike other Asus Eee Pad Slate EP121 screen protectors and skins, the TechSkin features \"self-healing\" technology, meaning scratches do not stay on the film, and keeps your Asus Eee Pad Slate EP121 looking new.For installation instructions and video please see: TechSkin Installation Instructions*Lifetime Warranty for this product is offered by the Skinomi.com, please contact Skinomi or review the FAQ section for more information regarding the warranty policy.WARNING: As with any electronic device, exposing it to excessive water or other fluids may cause harm to the device. Skinomi will not be responsible for any damage to the device caused by excessive water or improper application of the TechSkin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31IhuCpqbPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Skinomi","source_asin":"B004WQ6OZS","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1174609","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004WQ6OZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B004WQ6OZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
