window.products.push({"id":1174646,"name":"8K HDMI 2.1 Cable, 48Gbps Ultra HD Lead High-Speed Cord, Supports 8K@60Hz, 4K@120Hz, eARC HDR10, HDCP 2.2/2.3 Dolby, 3D, VRR, Compatible with Fire TV/","category":"electronics","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-+b3AANZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Real 8K HDMI 2.1 Cable】With a massive 48Gbps of bandwidth our 8K HDMI Cable provides unparalleled UHD transmission speeds. Enter a new world of picture quality with 4 times the resolution of 4K HDMI Cable. Photorealistic pictures with bright color and deep contrast. Backward compatible with all previous HDMI versions. 【Unparalleled Functionality】Packed full of the latest and greatest features, this 8K HDMI Cable supports the highest resolutions and refresh rates, Enjoy the ultra High definition ultimate watching experience on the big screen without any lagging. Including 8K (7680 x 4320) at 60Hz and 4K (3840 x 2160) at 120Hz. Dynamic HDR, HDCP 2.2/2.3, 12 bit RGB 4:4:4 & Dolby Vision. Unlock your gaming to the next level with VRR (Variable Refresh Rate), QMS, ALLM and QFT. 【Best-in-class Cable Design】The HDMI 2.1 cables are manufactured of 24K gold-plated HDMI connector, robust zinc alloy shell, 100% Bare copper, and covered with double nylon-braided jacket for the best performance and longer lifespan. Each cable is truly tested to support all the latest HDMI 2.1 specifications. It is able to withstand 10,000+ times plug and unplug, 2X durable than most HDMI cables in the market. 【Designed for Gaming】Works flawlessly with PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X/S, as well as any device that supports HDMI source with 4K@120Hz as specified in HDMI 2.1, including Sony 8K UHD TVs, Apple TV, and Roku Ultra. Support mirror and advanced mode for your work, study and entertainment provide the best viewing pleasure. 【Premium Support】Customer satisfaction is the most important ingredient at CableGeeker. You will get 8K HDMI Cable X 1. Far surpass peers 360-day quality warranty. If you have any questions about the highspeed HDMI cable 8K before or after your purchase, The professional customer service team will give you a satisfactory answer within 24 hours. ⚠️ When connecting your PC with graphics cards such as NVIDIA (RTX3060,3070,3080,3090 Series) and AMD(RX 6600,6700,6800,6900 Series) to 8K UHD TV. Remember to turn on the deep color function of TV sets(\"HDMI Ultra HD Deep Color\"). For the PC settings, be sure to choose the right Refresh rate: 3840x2160@120Hz and turn on HDR function(\"Display Setting\"→\"Advanced Display Settings\"→\"Windows HD Color\"→turn on \"Play HDR Games and Apps\"→OK), then you can enjoy your 4K@120Hz HDR games and videos.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-+b3AANZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CableGeeker","source_asin":"B097XVWNM7","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1174646","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097XVWNM7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B097XVWNM7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
