window.products.push({"id":1174745,"name":"TrackR bravo - Silver (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vh-DkHmzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description Tired of losing your keys, wallet, or phone? Make misplacing your belongings a thing of the past with TrackR bravo! Attach the coin-sized TrackR bravo to any item - then use the TrackR app to locate it in seconds. Quickly ring a missing wallet around the home or press the button on the TrackR to ring your phone on silent mode. TrackR's Crowd GPS Network enables you to even recover lost or stolen items on a map with GPS updates when another user walks by your missing item. From the Manufacturer $1,693,514 raised The Details Quickly ring your lost item through the TrackR App. Pressing the button on the TrackR device makes your phone ring, even on silent mode! Two-way separation alerts remind you to grab items before you leave them behind. The Details - See your item's last connected location on a map Item-Ringer If you can’t find your belongings, open the TrackR App and tap a button to make them ring. No more keys hiding in the couch! Phone Finder If you lose your phone all the time, there’s no need to have another TrackR to find it. Simply press the button on the TrackR device to make your phone ring - even on silent mode! 2 Way Separation Alerts Prevent losing your items in the first place with separation alerts. If you leave your TrackR device behind, both your phone and device ring! No more leaving your purse or wallet behind. Crowd GPS When your device goes out of Bluetooth range, other TrackR App users will help locate your device. Whenever another user comes within range of your device, you will be updated of its new location on a map. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Find your stuff Where did you get the inspiration for your product? We were inspired to create TrackR because we constantly misplaced our things. What differentiates your product from similar products out there? TrackR is the thinnest design to easily attach or stick to the things you want to track. At TrackR, we've created the largest Crowd GPS network to help find items that are lost or stolen. Tell us about the best and most challenging parts of the creation process. The most rewarding part of TrackR is hearing about all the people we help recover lost or stolen items. We are constantly working to perfect the product (and love hearing from customers!).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vh-DkHmzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TrackR","source_asin":"B01DPGPOTC","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1174745","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DPGPOTC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DPGPOTC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
