window.products.push({"id":1174839,"name":"AimCare New_Dell_Alien.Ware Aurora R11, Gaming Desktop Tower PC, Intel Core i7-10700F Processor, RTX 3060 Ti Graphics, 32GB RAM, 256GB SSD + 2TB SSHD,","category":"electronics","retail price":1099.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DdZaX3viS._AC_SL1237_.jpg","description":"ENHANCED ALIEN_FX The latest Alien_FX hardware and software supports full RGB values with up to 16.8 million colors.Easily manage your FX lighting zones, edit peripheral settings and save new themes you can then assign for each game. The future of design : The new Legend_Industrial_Design innovates the elements of Alien.ware's roots and pushes Aurora into a new realm. The unique design helps avid gamers stand out from the crowd thanks to bold, continuous lighting and the iconic central loop of Alien_FX that unleashes dynamic color versatility. Plus, thoughtfully positioned front I/O ports, easy to reach rear ports and upgradeable components offer extreme gaming flexibility. Finally, functional front airways and hexagonal-shaped side venting boosts intake efficiency and maximizes air movement. Legendary colors : Find your own battle style with either a Lunar Light or Dark Side of the Moon Alien.ware Aurora featuring an ultra-smooth, satin finish. It’s gaming love at first sight with the Aurora R11 Gaming Desktop PC This gaming desktop PC doesn’t just tout performance, but stunning looks as well. With tempered glass front and side panels, a full-metal frame, and complete RGB control, it’ll brighten up your battle station. 10th Gen i7-10700F latest processor makes your browsing and gaming faster than ever while the NVI.DIA Ge.Force RTX 3060 graphics card delivers the 4k performance that you crave. Dual storage options give this Aurora R11 desktop computer the responsiveness gamers need, while the 32 GB of RAM makes multitasking a breeze. Your setup has never been more modern with the Windows 10 operating system, a smoother wireless experience with both Wi-Fi 6 and Bluetooth 5.0. Aurora R11 Gaming Desktop confidently with a 1-year limited hardware warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DdZaX3viS._AC_SL1237_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AimCare","source_asin":"B09DPBQFQL","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1174839","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DPBQFQL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DPBQFQL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1174840,"name":"C2G 27590 DVI Male to HD15 VGA Female Video Extension Cable, Black (6.6 Feet, 2 Meters)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414Yp34QkEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Digital Visual Interface (DVI) is the standard interface for high-performance connection between PCs and flat panel displays, CRT displays, projectors, and HDTV. This video cable is fully compliant with the DVI standard defined by DDWG (Digital Display Working Group). Three analog 30 AWG coaxial lines enable high speed analog transmission. Tri-shielded undermold and braid shield protects against unwanted EMI/RFI interference. Each coax line is individually wrapped in foam-polyolefin insulation and overwrapped with a braided tinned copper shield. 28 AWG copper conductors are individually insulated in hard-density polypropylene to minimize crosstalk, and ensure high speed, error-free transmission. Gold-plated contacts provide full conductivity with no data loss. PC and Mac compatible cable supports hot-plugging of DVI display devices. PC-99 color-coded: blue, white.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414Yp34QkEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cables To Go","source_asin":"B00024OR62","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1174840","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00024OR62","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00024OR62","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
