window.products.push({"id":1174864,"name":"Memorex MW212 Home Compact Wireless Bluetooth Speaker Full Stereo Sound & Aux-in Input (Renewed)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZxA8HQNJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer The Memorex MW212 Universal Wireless Speaker packs expansive sound into an exceptionally compact frame. This speaker is wireless and can easily fit into a handbag or backpack. It features full Bluetooth support, allowing it to sync with your mobile device for easy wireless audio streaming. The speaker also supports wired connections to a broad range of audio devices with its 3.5-millimeter input. Memorex MW212 Product Shot Compact Bluetooth speaker delivers big audio performance. View larger. Memorex MW212 Product Shot Compact design is ideal for a variety of spaces. View larger. Compact, Convenient Design The MW212 Universal Wireless Speaker is an ideal accessory for music lovers. The speaker measures just over 7 inches across and can easily slip into a bag or backpack. It takes up very little space but can fill a bedroom, office, or dorm room with great sound. It also features intuitive controls, with an easily accessible panel providing instant control over power and volume. Bluetooth Support for Easy Wireless Streaming The MW212 speaker can sync with any Bluetooth device that uses the A2DP profile, enabling wireless connections to smartphones, MP3 players, tablets, and other devices. You'll be able to wirelessly stream your favorite playlists, listen to podcasts, or even take phone calls on the speaker. The speaker pairs with your Bluetooth device at the push of a button so you can wirelessly sync without any hassle. Crisp, Detailed Sound Performance Equipped with high-grade drivers and components, the MW212 speaker offers crisp sound performance. It plays back your music in full stereo audio, delivering clear highs and well-defined lows. In addition, Bluetooth data is streamed to the speaker with near-lossless fidelity so you can enjoy wireless audio content without dropouts or static. Versatile Connectivity Options The MW212 speaker is outfitted with a 3.5-millimeter line-in input, enabling wired connections to MP3 players, phones,","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZxA8HQNJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B016ZHVXOI","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1174864","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016ZHVXOI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B016ZHVXOI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
